                "difficulty": "medium",
                "question": "<p>A rectangle in the first\r                             quadrant is bound by the <em>x</em>-axis and <em>y</em>-axis with the upper\r                             right-hand vertex on the curve <img src=\"images/6d374a7ed1534fe6be5fa70fd9efbced.png\" class=\"exam-img\" style=\"max-width:100%; vertical-align:middle; margin:4px 0;\">. For which value of <em>x</em> will the rectangle have the largest\r                             area?</p>",
